    <briefdescription>
<para>C++ header file with declarations for the µTest++ human test reporter. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This header provides the declaration for <computeroutput>reporter_human</computeroutput>, a concrete implementation of the <computeroutput>reporter</computeroutput> abstract interface, selected with the <computeroutput>--reporter=human</computeroutput> command-line option, or with <computeroutput>runner_options::selected_reporter</computeroutput> (the default is TAP). It formats and presents test results in a human-readable form on the standard output, accumulating output in an internal string buffer and supporting colour-coded diagnostics and multiple verbosity levels.</para>
<para>All definitions reside within the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail" kindref="compound">micro_os_plus::micro_test_plus::detail</ref></computeroutput> namespace, since the reporters are internal to the framework.</para>
<para>The header files are organised within the <computeroutput>include/micro-os-plus/micro-test-plus</computeroutput> folder to maintain a structured and modular codebase.</para>
<para>This file is intended solely for internal use within the framework and should not be included directly by user code. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
